==Trivia==
[[File:Old KBD Lair.png|thumb|The former KBD Lair, which was visible by using the [[oculus orb]].]]
*Originally, when ''[[RuneScape 2]]'' was released, the [[King Black Dragon Lair]] was mapped by the Temple of Ikov. It was later changed due to [[safespot|safespotting]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/jagexash/status/497400311284518912|date=7 August 2014|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107893|archivedate=24 September 2018|quote=When RuneScape 2 came out, the KBD lair was mapped by the Temple of Ikov. It changed due to safe-spotting.}} It no longer exists in-game after an update. Players who were in the icy area of the Temple of Ikov could see some of the old KBD lair's tiles on their minimap, and even hear the lava bubbling if they stood close enough to the western wall.
*Players cannot trade each other while inside the dungeon.

